{
  "thag19.1:0.1": "",
  "thag19.1:0.2": "19. Paññāsanipāto ",
  "thag19.1:0.3": "",
  "thag19.1:0.4": "1. Tālapuṭattheragāthā 1094. ",
  "thag19.1:1.1": "‘‘Kadā nuhaṃ pabbatakandarāsu, ",
  "thag19.1:1.2": "ekākiyo addutiyo vihassaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:1.3": "Aniccato sabbabhavaṃ vipassaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:1.4": "taṃ me idaṃ taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:2.1": "1095. ‘‘Kadā nuhaṃ bhinnapaṭandharo muni, ",
  "thag19.1:2.2": "kāsāvavattho amamo nirāso; ",
  "thag19.1:2.3": "Rāgañca dosañca tatheva mohaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:2.4": "hantvā sukhī pavanagato vihassaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:3.1": "1096. ‘‘Kadā aniccaṃ vadharoganīḷaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:3.2": "kāyaṃ imaṃ maccujarāyupaddutaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:3.3": "Vipassamāno vītabhayo vihassaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:3.4": "eko vane taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:4.1": "1097. ‘‘Kadā nuhaṃ bhayajananiṃ dukhāvahaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:4.2": "taṇhālataṃ bahuvidhānuvattaniṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:4.3": "Paññāmayaṃ tikhiṇamasiṃ gahetvā, ",
  "thag19.1:4.4": "chetvā vase tampi kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:5.1": "1098. ‘‘Kadā nu paññāmayamuggatejaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:5.2": "satthaṃ isīnaṃ sahasādiyitvā; ",
  "thag19.1:5.3": "Māraṃ sasenaṃ sahasā bhañjissaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:5.4": "sīhāsane taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:6.1": "1099. ‘‘Kadā nuhaṃ sabbhi samāgamesu, ",
  "thag19.1:6.2": "diṭṭho bhave dhammagarūhi tādibhi; ",
  "thag19.1:6.3": "Yāthāvadassīhi jitindriyehi, ",
  "thag19.1:6.4": "padhāniyo taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:7.1": "1100. ‘‘Kadā nu maṃ tandi khudā pipāsā, ",
  "thag19.1:7.2": "vātātapā kīṭasarīsapā vā; ",
  "thag19.1:7.3": "Na bādhayissanti na taṃ giribbaje, ",
  "thag19.1:7.4": "atthatthiyaṃ taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:8.1": "1101. ‘‘Kadā nu kho yaṃ viditaṃ mahesinā, ",
  "thag19.1:8.2": "cattāri saccāni sududdasāni; ",
  "thag19.1:8.3": "Samāhitatto satimā agacchaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:8.4": "paññāya taṃ taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:9.1": "1102. ‘‘Kadā nu rūpe amite ca sadde, ",
  "thag19.1:9.2": "gandhe rase phusitabbe ca dhamme; ",
  "thag19.1:9.3": "Ādittatohaṃ samathehi yutto, ",
  "thag19.1:9.4": "paññāya dacchaṃ tadidaṃ kadā me. ",
  "thag19.1:10.1": "1103. ‘‘Kadā nuhaṃ dubbacanena vutto, ",
  "thag19.1:10.2": "tatonimittaṃ vimano na hessaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:10.3": "Atho pasatthopi tatonimittaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:10.4": "tuṭṭho na hessaṃ tadidaṃ kadā me. ",
  "thag19.1:11.1": "1104. ‘‘Kadā nu kaṭṭhe ca tiṇe latā ca, ",
  "thag19.1:11.2": "khandhe imehaṃ amite ca dhamme; ",
  "thag19.1:11.3": "Ajjhattikāneva ca bāhirāni ca, ",
  "thag19.1:11.4": "samaṃ tuleyyaṃ tadidaṃ kadā me. ",
  "thag19.1:12.1": "1105. ‘‘Kadā nu maṃ pāvusakālamegho, ",
  "thag19.1:12.2": "navena toyena sacīvaraṃ vane; ",
  "thag19.1:12.3": "Isippayātamhi pathe vajantaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:12.4": "ovassate taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:13.1": "1106. ‘‘Kadā mayūrassa sikhaṇḍino vane, ",
  "thag19.1:13.2": "dijassa sutvā girigabbhare rutaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:13.3": "Paccuṭṭhahitvā amatassa pattiyā, ",
  "thag19.1:13.4": "saṃcintaye taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:14.1": "1107. ‘‘Kadā nu gaṅgaṃ yamunaṃ sarassatiṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:14.2": "pātālakhittaṃ vaḷavāmukhañca ; ",
  "thag19.1:14.3": "Asajjamāno patareyyamiddhiyā, ",
  "thag19.1:14.4": "vibhiṃsanaṃ taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:15.1": "1108. ‘‘Kadā nu nāgova asaṅgacārī, ",
  "thag19.1:15.2": "padālaye kāmaguṇesu chandaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:15.3": "Nibbajjayaṃ sabbasubhaṃ nimittaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:15.4": "jhāne yuto taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:16.1": "1109. ‘‘Kadā iṇaṭṭova daliddako nidhiṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:16.2": "ārādhayitvā dhanikehi pīḷito; ",
  "thag19.1:16.3": "Tuṭṭho bhavissaṃ adhigamma sāsanaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:16.4": "mahesino taṃ nu kadā bhavissati. ",
  "thag19.1:17.1": "1110. ‘‘Bahūni vassāni tayāmhi yācito, ",
  "thag19.1:17.2": "‘agāravāsena alaṃ nu te idaṃ’; ",
  "thag19.1:17.3": "Taṃ dāni maṃ pabbajitaṃ samānaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:17.4": "kiṃkāraṇā citta tuvaṃ na yuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:18.1": "1111. ‘‘Nanu ahaṃ citta tayāmhi yācito, ",
  "thag19.1:18.2": "‘giribbaje citrachadā vihaṅgamā’; ",
  "thag19.1:18.3": "Mahindaghosatthanitābhigajjino, ",
  "thag19.1:18.4": "te taṃ ramessanti vanamhi jhāyinaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:19.1": "1112. ‘‘Kulamhi mitte ca piye ca ñātake, ",
  "thag19.1:19.2": "khiḍḍāratiṃ kāmaguṇañca loke; ",
  "thag19.1:19.3": "Sabbaṃ pahāya imamajjhupāgato, ",
  "thag19.1:19.4": "athopi tvaṃ citta na mayha tussasi. ",
  "thag19.1:20.1": "1113. ‘‘Mameva etaṃ na hi tvaṃ paresaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:20.2": "sannāhakāle paridevitena kiṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:20.3": "Sabbaṃ idaṃ calamiti pekkhamāno, ",
  "thag19.1:20.4": "abhinikkhamiṃ amatapadaṃ jigīsaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:21.1": "1114. ‘‘Suyuttavādī dvipadānamuttamo, ",
  "thag19.1:21.2": "mahābhisakko naradammasārathi ; ",
  "thag19.1:21.3": "‘Cittaṃ calaṃ makkaṭasannibhaṃ iti, ",
  "thag19.1:21.4": "avītarāgena sudunnivārayaṃ’. ",
  "thag19.1:22.1": "1115. ‘‘Kāmā hi citrā madhurā manoramā, ",
  "thag19.1:22.2": "aviddasū yattha sitā puthujjanā; ",
  "thag19.1:22.3": "Te dukkhamicchanti punabbhavesino, ",
  "thag19.1:22.4": "cittena nītā niraye nirākatā. ",
  "thag19.1:23.1": "1116. ‘‘‘Mayūrakoñcābhirutamhi kānane, ",
  "thag19.1:23.2": "dīpīhi byagghehi purakkhato vasaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:23.3": "Kāye apekkhaṃ jaha mā virādhaya’, ",
  "thag19.1:23.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:24.1": "1117. ‘‘‘Bhāvehi jhānāni ca indriyāni ca, ",
  "thag19.1:24.2": "balāni bojjhaṅgasamādhibhāvanā; ",
  "thag19.1:24.3": "Tisso ca vijjā phusa buddhasāsane’, ",
  "thag19.1:24.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:25.1": "1118. ‘‘‘Bhāvehi maggaṃ amatassa pattiyā, ",
  "thag19.1:25.2": "niyyānikaṃ sabbadukhakkhayogadhaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:25.3": "Aṭṭhaṅgikaṃ sabbakilesasodhanaṃ’, ",
  "thag19.1:25.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:26.1": "1119. ‘‘‘Dukkhanti khandhe paṭipassa yoniso, ",
  "thag19.1:26.2": "yato ca dukkhaṃ samudeti taṃ jaha; ",
  "thag19.1:26.3": "Idheva dukkhassa karohi antaṃ’, ",
  "thag19.1:26.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:27.1": "1120. ‘‘‘Aniccaṃ dukkhanti vipassa yoniso, ",
  "thag19.1:27.2": "suññaṃ anattāti aghaṃ vadhanti ca; ",
  "thag19.1:27.3": "Manovicāre uparundha cetaso’, ",
  "thag19.1:27.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:28.1": "1121. ‘‘‘Muṇḍo virūpo abhisāpamāgato, ",
  "thag19.1:28.2": "kapālahatthova kulesu bhikkhasu; ",
  "thag19.1:28.3": "Yuñjassu satthuvacane mahesino’, ",
  "thag19.1:28.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:29.1": "1122. ‘‘‘Susaṃvutatto visikhantare caraṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:29.2": "kulesu kāmesu asaṅgamānaso; ",
  "thag19.1:29.3": "Cando yathā dosinapuṇṇamāsiyā’, ",
  "thag19.1:29.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:30.1": "1123. ‘‘‘Āraññiko hohi ca piṇḍapātiko, ",
  "thag19.1:30.2": "sosāniko hohi ca paṃsukūliko; ",
  "thag19.1:30.3": "Nesajjiko hohi sadā dhute rato’, ",
  "thag19.1:30.4": "itissu maṃ citta pure niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:31.1": "1124. ‘‘Ropetva rukkhāni yathā phalesī, ",
  "thag19.1:31.2": "mūle taruṃ chettu tameva icchasi; ",
  "thag19.1:31.3": "Tathūpamaṃ cittamidaṃ karosi, ",
  "thag19.1:31.4": "yaṃ maṃ aniccamhi cale niyuñjasi. ",
  "thag19.1:32.1": "1125. ‘‘Arūpa dūraṅgama ekacāri, ",
  "thag19.1:32.2": "na te karissaṃ vacanaṃ idānihaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:32.3": "Dukkhā hi kāmā kaṭukā mahabbhayā, ",
  "thag19.1:32.4": "nibbānamevābhimano carissaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:33.1": "1126. ‘‘Nāhaṃ alakkhyā ahirikkatāya vā, ",
  "thag19.1:33.2": "na cittahetū na ca dūrakantanā; ",
  "thag19.1:33.3": "Ājīvahetū ca ahaṃ na nikkhamiṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:33.4": "kato ca te citta paṭissavo mayā. ",
  "thag19.1:34.1": "1127. ‘‘‘Appicchatā sappurisehi vaṇṇitā, ",
  "thag19.1:34.2": "makkhappahānaṃ vūpasamo dukhassa’; ",
  "thag19.1:34.3": "Itissu maṃ citta tadā niyuñjasi, ",
  "thag19.1:34.4": "idāni tvaṃ gacchasi pubbaciṇṇaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:35.1": "1128. ‘‘Taṇhā avijjā ca piyāpiyañca, ",
  "thag19.1:35.2": "subhāni rūpāni sukhā ca vedanā; ",
  "thag19.1:35.3": "Manāpiyā kāmaguṇā ca vantā, ",
  "thag19.1:35.4": "vante ahaṃ āvamituṃ na ussahe. ",
  "thag19.1:36.1": "1129. ‘‘Sabbattha te citta vaco kataṃ mayā, ",
  "thag19.1:36.2": "bahūsu jātīsu na mesi kopito; ",
  "thag19.1:36.3": "Ajjhattasambhavo kataññutāya te, ",
  "thag19.1:36.4": "dukkhe ciraṃ saṃsaritaṃ tayā kate. ",
  "thag19.1:37.1": "1130. ‘‘Tvaññeva no citta karosi brāhmaṇo , ",
  "thag19.1:37.2": "tvaṃ khattiyo rājadasī karosi; ",
  "thag19.1:37.3": "Vessā ca suddā ca bhavāma ekadā, ",
  "thag19.1:37.4": "devattanaṃ vāpi taveva vāhasā. ",
  "thag19.1:38.1": "1131. ‘‘Taveva hetū asurā bhavāmase, ",
  "thag19.1:38.2": "tvaṃmūlakaṃ nerayikā bhavāmase; ",
  "thag19.1:38.3": "Atho tiracchānagatāpi ekadā, ",
  "thag19.1:38.4": "petattanaṃ vāpi taveva vāhasā. ",
  "thag19.1:39.1": "1132. ‘‘Nanu dubbhissasi maṃ punappunaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:39.2": "muhuṃ muhuṃ cāraṇikaṃva dassayaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:39.3": "Ummattakeneva mayā palobhasi, ",
  "thag19.1:39.4": "kiñcāpi te citta virādhitaṃ mayā. ",
  "thag19.1:40.1": "1133. ‘‘Idaṃ pure cittamacāri cārikaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:40.2": "yenicchakaṃ yatthakāmaṃ yathāsukhaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:40.3": "Tadajjahaṃ niggahessāmi yoniso, ",
  "thag19.1:40.4": "hatthippabhinnaṃ viya aṅkusaggaho. ",
  "thag19.1:41.1": "1134. ‘‘Satthā ca me lokamimaṃ adhiṭṭhahi, ",
  "thag19.1:41.2": "aniccato addhuvato asārato; ",
  "thag19.1:41.3": "Pakkhanda maṃ citta jinassa sāsane, ",
  "thag19.1:41.4": "tārehi oghā mahatā suduttarā. ",
  "thag19.1:42.1": "1135. ‘‘Na te idaṃ citta yathā purāṇakaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:42.2": "nāhaṃ alaṃ tuyha vase nivattituṃ ; ",
  "thag19.1:42.3": "Mahesino pabbajitomhi sāsane, ",
  "thag19.1:42.4": "na mādisā honti vināsadhārino. ",
  "thag19.1:43.1": "1136. ‘‘Nagā samuddā saritā vasundharā, ",
  "thag19.1:43.2": "disā catasso vidisā adho divā; ",
  "thag19.1:43.3": "Sabbe aniccā tibhavā upaddutā, ",
  "thag19.1:43.4": "kuhiṃ gato citta sukhaṃ ramissasi. ",
  "thag19.1:44.1": "1137. ‘‘Dhitipparaṃ kiṃ mama citta kāhisi, ",
  "thag19.1:44.2": "na te alaṃ citta vasānuvattako; ",
  "thag19.1:44.3": "Na jātu bhastaṃ ubhatomukhaṃ chupe, ",
  "thag19.1:44.4": "dhiratthu pūraṃ nava sotasandaniṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:45.1": "1138. ‘‘Varāhaeṇeyyavigāḷhasevite, ",
  "thag19.1:45.2": "pabbhārakuṭṭe pakateva sundare; ",
  "thag19.1:45.3": "Navambunā pāvusasitthakānane, ",
  "thag19.1:45.4": "tahiṃ guhāgehagato ramissasi. ",
  "thag19.1:46.1": "1139. ‘‘Sunīlagīvā susikhā supekhunā, ",
  "thag19.1:46.2": "sucittapattacchadanā vihaṅgamā; ",
  "thag19.1:46.3": "Sumañjughosatthanitābhigajjino, ",
  "thag19.1:46.4": "te taṃ ramessanti vanamhi jhāyinaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:47.1": "1140. ‘‘Vuṭṭhamhi deve caturaṅgule tiṇe, ",
  "thag19.1:47.2": "saṃpupphite meghanibhamhi kānane; ",
  "thag19.1:47.3": "Nagantare viṭapisamo sayissaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:47.4": "taṃ me mudū hehiti tūlasannibhaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:48.1": "1141. ‘‘Tathā tu kassāmi yathāpi issaro, ",
  "thag19.1:48.2": "yaṃ labbhati tenapi hotu me alaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:48.3": "Na tāhaṃ kassāmi yathā atandito, ",
  "thag19.1:48.4": "biḷārabhastaṃva yathā sumadditaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:49.1": "1142. ‘‘Tathā tu kassāmi yathāpi issaro, ",
  "thag19.1:49.2": "yaṃ labbhati tenapi hotu me alaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:49.3": "Vīriyena taṃ mayha vasānayissaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:49.4": "gajaṃva mattaṃ kusalaṅkusaggaho. ",
  "thag19.1:50.1": "1143. ‘‘Tayā sudantena avaṭṭhitena hi, ",
  "thag19.1:50.2": "hayena yoggācariyova ujjunā; ",
  "thag19.1:50.3": "Pahomi maggaṃ paṭipajjituṃ sivaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:50.4": "cittānurakkhīhi sadā nisevitaṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:51.1": "1144. ‘‘Ārammaṇe taṃ balasā nibandhisaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:51.2": "nāgaṃva thambhamhi daḷhāya rajjuyā; ",
  "thag19.1:51.3": "Taṃ me suguttaṃ satiyā subhāvitaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:51.4": "anissitaṃ sabbabhavesu hehisi. ",
  "thag19.1:52.1": "1145. ‘‘Paññāya chetvā vipathānusārinaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:52.2": "yogena niggayha pathe nivesiya; ",
  "thag19.1:52.3": "Disvā samudayaṃ vibhavañca sambhavaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:52.4": "dāyādako hehisi aggavādino. ",
  "thag19.1:53.1": "1146. ‘‘Catubbipallāsavasaṃ adhiṭṭhitaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:53.2": "gāmaṇḍalaṃva parinesi citta maṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:53.3": "Nanu saṃyojanabandhanacchidaṃ, ",
  "thag19.1:53.4": "saṃsevase kāruṇikaṃ mahāmuniṃ. ",
  "thag19.1:54.1": "1147. ‘‘Migo yathā seri sucittakānane, ",
  "thag19.1:54.2": "rammaṃ giriṃ pāvusaabbhamāliniṃ ; ",
  "thag19.1:54.3": "Anākule tattha nage ramissaṃ , ",
  "thag19.1:54.4": "asaṃsayaṃ citta parā bhavissasi. ",
  "thag19.1:55.1": "1148. ‘‘Ye tuyha chandena vasena vattino, ",
  "thag19.1:55.2": "narā ca nārī ca anubhonti yaṃ sukhaṃ; ",
  "thag19.1:55.3": "Aviddasū māravasānuvattino, ",
  "thag19.1:55.4": "bhavābhinandī tava citta sāvakā’’ti. … ",
  "thag19.1:55.5": "Tālapuṭo thero…. ",
  "thag19.1:55.6": "Paññāsanipāto niṭṭhito. ",
  "thag19.1:56.0": "Tatruddānaṃ – ",
  "thag19.1:56.1": "Paññāsamhi nipātamhi, ",
  "thag19.1:56.2": "eko tālapuṭo suci; ",
  "thag19.1:56.3": "Gāthāyo tattha paññāsa, ",
  "thag19.1:56.4": "puna pañca ca uttarīti. "
}
